### Summary of Errors
The error indicates that each test failed while trying to access `http://localhost:8195/`, which means that the application server started by the test did not correctly start up or was unreachable when the tests tried to connect.

### Analyzing Each Unit Test

1. **Test for User Login (`test_user_login`)**
